Subject: bpf: Fix overloading of MEM_UNINIT's meaning

[ Upstream commit 8ea607330a39184f51737c6ae706db7fdca7628e ]

Lonial reported an issue in the BPF verifier where check_mem_size_reg()
has the following code:

